    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakatuma dî bua bakulu bonso ba mu Yuda ne Yelushalema badisangishe kudiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakabuela mu nsubu wa Yehowa ne bantu bonso ba mu Yuda ne bonso ba mu Yelushalema bakadi nʼandi, ne bakuidi ne baprofete ne bantu bonso, ne bakese ne banene; yeye wakababadila mei onso a mu mukanda wa tshihungidi wakasanganabo mu nsubu wa Yehowa mu matshu abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakimana hehi ne dikunshi dia mu nsubu, wakahunga tshihungidi ku mpala kua Yehowa bua kuendeye ku mpala kua Yehowa ne bua kutumikila mikenji yandi ne mei andi ne mikandu yandi ne mutshima wandi wonso ne muoyo wandi wonso, ne hua kuenzeye mei onso a tshihungidi akadi mafunda mu mukanda eu; bantu bonso bakajadika tshihungidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakela dî kudi Hilekiya, muakuidi munene, ne kudi bakuidi ba mu mulongo muibidi ne kudi balami ba nsubu bua bobo bumushe malonga onso a Bâla ne a Bashela ne a kutendelela nʼau misumba yonso ya mu diulu mu nsubu wa Yehowa; wakayosha ku mpenge kua Yelushalema mu madimi a ku Kidelona; bakaya ne butue buabi ku Betele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakumusha bakuidi batendeledi ba mpingu, bakasungula bakelenge ba Yuda bua kuoshabo musenga wa manananshi mu bitendelelu bia ku mikuna bia mu misoko ya Yuda ne ku miaba yakanyungulula Yelushalema; wakumusha bakuidi bakadi boshela Bâla ne diba ne ngondo ne mitoto ne misumba yonso ya mu diulu manananshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakumusha luhingu lua Ashela mu nsubu wa Yehowa, wakaya nʼalu ku mpenge ya Yelushalema ku kasulu ka Kidelona, wakaluosha ku kasulu ka Kidelona, wakalubutula bu luhuishi, wakela luhuishi ha nkita ya bantu ba tshianana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakashimbula nsubu ya bena Sodoma yakadi ha buihi ne nsubu wa Yehowa kuakadi bakashi bakuma bilulu bia Bashela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakumusha bakuidi bonso mu misoko yonso ya mu Yuda, wakanyanga bitendelelu biakadi bakuidi boshahu musenga wa manananshi ku Geba tô ne ku Bê-sheba; wakashimbula bitendelelu biakadi ku tshibuelelu tshia ku tshibi tshia Yoshua, mukelenge wa musoko, biakadi ku tshianza tshia bakashi tshia ku tshibi tshia musoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bakuidi ba ku bitendelelu abi kabakalua ku tshioshelu tshia Yehowa tshia mu Yelushalema; bakadia bidia biakadi kabiyi ne luevene munkatshi mua bana habo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakanyanga Tofete wakadi mu tshibanda tshia bana ba Hinoma, bua muntu kahitshishi muanʼandi wa balume anyi muanʼandi wa bakashi mu kahia ka Moleke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakumusha tubalu tuakajidila bakelenge ba Yuda kudi diba, tuakadi ku tshibuelelu tshia nsubu wa Yehowa, hehi ne nsubu wa Natana-meleke, mulami wa nsubu, wakadi mu luhangu lua nsubu; wakosha makalu a diba mu kahia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakashimbula bioshelu biakadi ku mutu kua nsubu wa Ahaza, biakenza bakelenge ba Yuda; ne bioshelu biakenza Manashe mu biendedi bibidi bia mu nsubu wa Yehowa; wakaubutula, wakela lufuishi luabi mu kasulu ka Kidelona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakanyanga bitendelelu bia ku mikuna biakadi ku mpala kua Yelushalema, biakadi ku tshianza tshia balume tshia ku mukuna wa dibutuka wakashila mukelenge Solomo Bashatolete, nzambi wa bundu wa Bena Sidona, ne wa Kemoshe, nzambi wa bundu wa Bena Moaba, ne wa Milekoma, nzambi wa bundu wa Bena Amona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakambula makunshi ne wakashimbula mpingu bia Bashela; wakanyanga miaba ei ne mifuba ya bantu bafue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakashimbula kabidi tshioshelu tshiakadi ku Betele ne tshitendelelu tshiakenza Yalobama, muana wa Nebata, wakenzesha Bena Isalele malu mabi; wakosha tshitendelelu, wakatshibutula bu luhuishi, wakosha mpingu ya Bashela mu kahia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatshunguluka Yoshiya, yeye wakatangila nkita yakadi ku mikuna; wakatuma bantu, bakangata mifuba yakadi mu nkita, bakayosha ha tshioshelu, wakatshinyanga bu mu dî dia Yehowa diakamba muntu wa Nzambi wakadi wamba ne, Malu â alualua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe wakebesha ne, Atshi ntshivulukidi tshia nganyi tshindi ntangila? Bena musoko bakamuambila ne, Alu ndukita lua muntu wa Nzambi wakafuma mu Yuda, wakamba malu awakenzela tshioshelu etshi tshia mu Betele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Bamulekele; muntu kumushi mifuba yandi nansha. Nunku bakalekela mifuba yandi ne mifuba ya muprofete wakafuma ku Samalea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshiya wakumusha nsubu yonso ya bitendelelu bia ku mikuna bia mu misoko ya Samalea biakenza bakelenge ba Isalele bia kufuisha nʼabi Yehowa tshiji, wakatuenzela bu muakenzeleye bintu bia mu Betele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakashiha bakuidi ba bitendelelu abi ha bioshelu biabo, wakoshahu mifuba ya bantu; nunku wakahingana ku Yelushalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakelela bantu bonso mukenji ne. Nudie bidia bia kuhita kua Yehowa, Nzambi wenu, bu mudibo bafunde mu mukanda eu wa tshihungidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulelela, kabakudia bidia bia kuhita kua Yehowa nunku ku matuku a balumbuluishi bakalumbuluila Bena Isalele nansha mu matuku onso a bakelenge ba Isalele nansha a bakelenge ba Yuda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi bakadila Yehowa bidia bia kuhita kua Yehowa mu Yelushalema mu tshidimu tshia dikumi ne muanda mukulu tshia bukelenge bua Yoshiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshiya wakumusha kabidi bena mbuku ne bena muhongo ne mpingu yonso ne malu a bundu onso biakadi mu Yuda ne mu Yelushalema bua yeye ajadike mei onso a mikenji akadi mafunda mu mukanda wakasangana Hilekiya muakuidi mu nsubu wa Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuakadi mukelenge mukuabo ku mpala kuandi wakakudimuna mutshima wandi ne muoyo wandi ne bukole buandi kudi Yehowa bua kutumikileye mikenji yonso ya Mose bu muakenzeye; kakuakadi mukelenge mukuabo wakalonda ku nyima kuandi bu yeye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yehowa kakandamuka ku bukole bua tshiji tshiandi tshikole tshiakadiye nʼatshi kudi Bena Yuda, bualu bua malu mabi onso akenza Manashe akamufuisheye nʼau tshiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakamba ne, Nengumushe Bena Yuda kabidi ku mesu kuanyi bu munakumusha Bena Isalele, nenyenge musoko eu wa Yelushalema mene unakusungula, ne nsubu unakuamba ne, Nenjadikemu dina dianyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bikuabo bia Yoshiya ne malu onso akenzeye kabiena bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ba Yuda, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu matuku andi Palô-neko, mukelenge wa Ejipitu, wakaya ku musulu wa Pelata bua kuluanganeye ne mukelenge wa Ashû; mukelenge Yoshiya wakaluhuka bua kuluanganeye nʼandi, Palô-neko wakamushiha ku Megido hakamutangileye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bandi bakamuambila mu dikalu diandi mufue, bumuke ku Megido, bakalua nʼandi ku Yelushalema, bakamujika mu lukita luandi. Bena buloba bakangata Yehoaza, muana wa Yoshiya, bakamuela manyi ha mutu, bakamusungula mukelenge mu muaba wa tatu wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
